  "$id": "https://fmlume.invalid/schemas/fmlume-preset.schema.json",
  "title": "FMLUME preset (.fmlume), schemaVersion 2",
  "description": "Structural schema. Rules a JSON Schema cannot express are enforced by the loader: the operator graph must be acyclic with no self or duplicate edges; at least one enabled operator needs carrierGain > 0 and level > 0; fx.processors must contain each effect type exactly once; macro targets must be continuous parameters; mapping min <= max. See docs/PRESET_SCHEMA.md.",
